# Third-party pieces are fetched, not committed (third_party/fetch.sh)
third_party/*
!third_party/fetch.sh
# Build output, renders, captures
build/
out/
tools/smoke/out/
*.exr
__pycache__/
captures/
# This computer's choices (the language: src/app/lang.h) and the journey of scene 7's second option (Hız)
user.cfg
hiz_yolculuk.txt*

# Koy: CC0 scans fetched by assets/koy/fetch.py, not committed
assets/koy/cc0/
assets/koy/_dl/

# Ölçek: data fetched and prepared by tools/olcek_veri.py, not committed (the sources: assets/olcek/KAYNAKLAR.md)
assets/olcek/*
!assets/olcek/KAYNAKLAR.md

# Scene 8: the baked light (cache/denizalti/), rebuilt by the oven
cache/
# Scene 8: reference pictures (various licences: private reference, see docs/denizalti/REFERANS.md)
assets/denizalti/referans/

# Orman: open-licence assets fetched by assets/orman/fetch.py, not committed (sources: docs/orman/VARLIK.md)
assets/orman/cc0/
assets/orman/_dl/

# Ateş: open-licence assets fetched by assets/ates/fetch.py, not committed (sources: docs/ates/VARLIK.md)
assets/ates/cc0/
assets/ates/_dl/

# Dag: elevation and imagery fetched and prepared by tools/dag_veri.py, not committed (sources: assets/dag/KAYNAKLAR.md)
assets/dag/*
!assets/dag/KAYNAKLAR.md
